      "number": 24,
      "title": "The Secret Cave",
      "synopsis": "Alone in the cave, Dantès breaks the final barrier and verifies every category of Faria’s promised fortune. Dantès tests the coins and gems, takes only what he can conceal, and reseals the chamber before the crew returns.",
      "notes": "",
      "wordGoal": null
    },
