      "timelineId": "count-of-monte-cristo-timeline-main",
      "number": 30,
      "title": "The Fifth of September",
      "synopsis": "At the deadline, Julie finds the red purse and redeemed bills, and a new Pharaon enters the harbour before Morrel can take his life. The family runs to the window as a replacement ship bearing the old name arrives with a full cargo.",
      "notes": "",
      "wordGoal": null
